    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "MIDWAY AIRLINES\nTIMETABLE\n•Effective May 1, 1991\nIncluding\nMidway Airlines\nMidway Connection®\nOur new reservations telephone\nnumber is 1-800-866-9000.",
      "AVOID\nTHE\nCHICAGO, IL-O'HARE\nORDEAL.\n53-92-20\nFly Midway Airlines® to Chicago's\nMidway Airport. It's Chicago's \"express\"\nairport-it's easier to get in and out of\nand twice as close to downtown. For flights\nto over 40 cities 400 times a day, call\nyour travel agent or call Midway Airlines\nat 1-800-866-9000.\nMidway Airlines®\n© 1991 Midway Airlines, Inc."
    ],
